Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Interactive Exploration", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"603850aa-5dcc-044a-a0a6-8a2aa0328e4c"],

Cell["\<\
Lab 4A lets you compare how virtual-Z PhaseFreedom modes unlock infeasible \
short CNOT durations (e.g. 400 us) while visualising the optimised pre- and \
post-pulse Z-rotation angles. Lab 4B lets you tune the RunningCost \
StatePenalty weight and TimeWeighting profile to trade peak forbidden-state \
suppression against convergence speed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ec101eb7-9ed7-bd4e-af9c-40ce44c85ad6"],

