Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d834d1da-b27f-1e42-845f-9f95aedcaa22"],

Cell["\<\
1. Virtual-Z CNOT threshold: In Lab 4A at Duration = 400 us, test \
PhaseFreedom = \"None\" (hits quantum speed-limit ceiling ~0.707) vs \"Global\
\" vs \"BothZ\" (~0.9996).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"66f12505-885e-9a4a-9a63-4cf133bfdf0c"],

Cell["\<\
2. LeftZ vs BothZ: Notice how \"BothZ\" distributes virtual rotations between \
input and output reference frames, achieving high fidelity in fewer \
iterations than \"LeftZ\" alone.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9fd2798d-00e8-3242-af42-4b7a97ffd46f"],

Cell["\<\
3. Penalty TimeWeighting shape: In Lab 4B with Weight = 4.0, switch \
TimeWeighting to \"FinalHalf\" vs \"Uniform\" and observe where population \
shifts on the trajectory plot.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"9cd20248-c2d3-1347-90e9-1ef049ebd5d8"],

Cell["\<\
4. Set Weight = 0.0 (unpenalised) in Lab 4B to confirm peak |alpha,beta> \
occupancy rises cleanly toward ~0.395 while terminal fidelity stays near 1.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6a522a4b-7bf9-2f42-9cb9-d36c9622eb87"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"69442da3-1704-2042-af5c-1478f16ed0af"],

Cell["\<\
Cooperative objectives, heterogeneous multi-system co-design, subspace \
leakage control, virtual-Z phase equivalence, intermediate RunningCost \
penalties, and joint slice/delay duration optimisation extend GRAPE cleanly \
to realistic experimental compromises beyond textbook fixed-grid unitary \
synthesis.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"342c54af-9659-a34f-b4fe-4391236b7218"],

